{"version":1,"key":"article:68","content":{"id":68,"title":"HTTP 缓存","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1d7abf5b-8317-44f6-91e0-950285e506df","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"什么是拷贝？对一个变量进行拷贝是指将其表示的数据复制到另一个变量中，大部分情况下的目的是为了避免直接修改原始数据，以便后续进行多种不同的处理或对比。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e4443123-157a-44df-a636-f0382bc4eaaf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最简单的拷贝行为，直接将一个变量赋值给另一个变量"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"8f913376-0589-4d7d-a0d2-463dfa6ab843","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"717d6701-39bf-439c-9a4a-dac9189d0ef4","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let a = 1;\nlet b = a;\nb = 2;\nconsole.log(a, b); // 1, 2","collabId":"6c22f2a3-e927-4d3e-82f5-c7974c1724eb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"770f270e-2864-4cd6-a880-a1a8135d1280","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"48fa3741-60e5-4083-bd77-2034a0ad0908","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1\n}\nconst copyObj = originalObj;\ncopyObj.a = 2;\nconsole.log(originalObj.a, copyObj.a); // 2, 2","collabId":"9c718c8d-3668-4943-84f2-e77444bc02de","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f9cbef67-74f0-4829-89cd-59602998d4bd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以看到，这种直接赋值的方式对于基本数据类型和对象是不一样的，对于基本数据类型（"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"number"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"string"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"null"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"undefined"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"boolean"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"BigInt"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）直接赋值是完全隔离的，对拷贝的修改不会影响原数据，而对于对象（包括数组、日期、函数等特殊对象）直接进行赋值拷贝，"},{"type":"formatted","color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","bold":true,"text":"拷贝的仅仅是引用"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因此对通过拷贝所持有的引用对数据进行的修改也会影响原来的对象。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ddba5cba-3ede-452f-98bf-ce02dd933ccf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因此对于对象的拷贝不能通过直接赋值来达到目的，而是需要将引用的数据进行拷贝，根据拷贝方式的不同，分为浅拷贝和深拷贝。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"207b7a5b-1854-4745-9018-b513a1978e88","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"浅拷贝即只复制对象的一层属性，常见的方式有"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"8f044d89-7bf5-470d-8ff0-88ca4fac1b25","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9aa30310-6135-4bd8-a220-ace1a0a2eb45","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1\n}\nconst copyObj = {};\nfor (let key in obj1) {\n    obj2[key] = obj1[key];\n}","collabId":"6f5b6398-461d-47aa-a224-e18ae9acbc6c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"00fdb771-defb-4694-afd9-c9f216703eb3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0965af91-23f5-4ceb-b093-97757318a7ef","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1\n}\nconst copyObj = { \n    ...obj1\n}","collabId":"100da66c-0c93-4e24-98a6-3c821b8e9deb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"f148df4b-57e1-48bd-a462-a525dd092a23","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1ca5727c-2413-4964-8ea7-84e6f0f8ad77","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1\n}\nconst copyObj = Object.assign({}, originalObj);","collabId":"ea466cfe-63e1-4dbc-a1eb-619f1a8aa6ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d644269d-f40e-494b-a599-247d7223b473","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果对象的属性的值也是一个对象，那么就会存在问题，复制的仍然是一个引用，对该引用的修改同样会影响原对象"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"f5033822-9a7d-461d-83a6-fa56705609db","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"13e367a5-f58f-46ca-b939-6df2fa223c25","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: {\n        b: 1\n    }\n}\nconst copyObj = Object.assign({}, originalObj);\ncopyObj.a.b = 2;\nconsole.log(originalObj.a.b, copyObj.a.b); // 2 2","collabId":"cf567cc3-678c-4bc2-9cba-d0afa1d4a334","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7fd43b75-a776-48c8-b4b2-01ca088003a0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果希望对拷贝的值的修改完全不影响原对象，这种情况下就需要进行深拷贝了。"}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"red","tauContract":"8d7373dfc1d83f7abd6f07067a85198c9127dba4aebf48d6d59b33956048da37","collabId":"2f31d391-a42b-47c4-8e06-2d3c2aa0e6ac","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"16a3874b-bacb-44e9-9e3a-3d05384248a8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大部分情况下不需要使用深拷贝，原因："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"157f7588-f63e-4b55-bef1-b737c35e34e1","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"36916cb8-f727-4760-ab13-829b77f0f552","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3164d747-c448-4e15-9955-13b8be54c000","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"浅拷贝够用了"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3ee90792-25c9-4771-96d2-53afeaf4eae6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"79671af1-a55c-4b95-822f-f7b05a1ebefe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"深拷贝性能较低"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"f37f6d39-d20e-40e0-b9a1-28f4d5318d17","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"JSON.parse、JSON.stringify"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7411102c-7a70-4e32-b4f7-c2ab2618ad25","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一种序列化的方式是将对象先序列为字符串，然后根据字符串重新反序列化为对象，该种方式创建的对象是完全开辟一块新的内存空间，和原来的对象没有任何关系："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"7f0facbc-cd32-4544-8e03-3de0924dba35","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"cb8338e5-fe87-4b22-80b3-a566201dcf9f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: {\n        b: 1\n    }\n}\nconst copyObj = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(originalObj));\ncopyObj.a.b = 2;\n\nconsole.log(originalObj.a.b, copyObj.a.b); // 1 2","collabId":"331353de-4e5b-49d2-a398-0c3ccc623615","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7170e680-2ae8-4b55-8010-77c0698378f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是该种方式有很多缺点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"1c1edc8a-2079-4e22-976a-c40c41b5748f","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"43012b32-f023-4bc5-b4e0-38ffa80ceb67","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b743e887-e4e1-4715-a36b-4e33f884fa72","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"只能处理被序列化的对象，对于特殊类型的对象在反序列化时会丢失特定的类型信息"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"c366cfaf-1565-4d0a-8214-ebbb6e793873","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"fda19f13-9c94-4ed4-b4d1-e7fce68257a6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"be5732db-e585-44a7-8268-44476fbcb1f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Date"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会被序列化为字符串"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"04bfaa6b-bd4d-43ea-9361-df0b2803ce85","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bb3c8cea-2669-44f1-9adb-61b0d88b3151","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"RegExp"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise、Map、Set、WeakMap、WeakSet"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会被序列化为空对象"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"36ee237d-4aa9-4f6e-95e7-ff6d00db96cf","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e6d1ff03-a429-47f2-b347-dd303d775e63","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Function"},{"type":"formatted","text":" ，DOM 对象会被忽略"}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"6e6e5e93-e61b-4728-85e5-6c2dc6592ebc","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c61b8c39-aba9-430c-831f-5ef62d094543","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1,\n    b: new Date(),\n    c: new RegExp('\\\\d{2}'),\n    d: function () {\n        return 'hello'\n    },\n    e: Promise.resolve('world'),\n    f: new Map([['a', 1], ['b', 2]]),\n    g: new Set([1, 2, 3]),\n    h: new WeakMap(),\n    i: new WeakSet()\n}\nconst copyObj = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(originalObj));","collabId":"b2241047-a900-4144-a05a-eb9b04f52ca0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2ce054a3-ba08-44ff-9851-3b8ebad6bfeb.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2ce054a3-ba08-44ff-9851-3b8ebad6bfeb.png","width":427.5,"naturalWidth":855,"naturalHeight":740,"tauContract":"9